      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 2.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.41,
      "end_seconds": 6.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "hello, thanks for fitting me in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.68,
      "end_seconds": 9.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.83,
      "end_seconds": 13.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I've, I've been wanting contraception."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.31,
      "end_seconds": 18.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.24,
      "end_seconds": 24.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "So, it's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.37,
      "end_seconds": 41.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.23,
      "end_seconds": 45.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I've had it for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.43,
      "end_seconds": 50.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.3,
      "end_seconds": 52.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.24,
      "end_seconds": 58.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.41,
      "end_seconds": 65.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get slightly heavy periods as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.82,
      "end_seconds": 79.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Any migraine with aura, breast lumps or smoking at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.78,
      "end_seconds": 86.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "No migraine with aura, breast lumps or smoking, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.25,
      "end_seconds": 97.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "no, you know, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.76,
      "end_seconds": 118.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.8,
      "end_seconds": 123.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Well, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.03,
      "end_seconds": 126.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.38,
      "end_seconds": 130.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.98,
      "end_seconds": 131.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.88,
      "end_seconds": 137.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.24,
      "end_seconds": 142.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.03,
      "end_seconds": 147.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.85,
      "end_seconds": 151.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Right, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.02,
      "end_seconds": 158.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.18,
      "end_seconds": 162.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.14,
      "end_seconds": 167.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "So, my mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.45,
      "end_seconds": 172.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.04,
      "end_seconds": 175.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.93,
      "end_seconds": 185.79,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "right, so heart disease is already on your record we'll keep that in mind today let's start with the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.3,
      "end_seconds": 194.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.31,
      "end_seconds": 216.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 71, temperature is 36.4 degrees, pressure 118 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.76,
      "end_seconds": 222.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.02,
      "end_seconds": 224.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.85,
      "end_seconds": 227.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.09,
      "end_seconds": 245.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.25,
      "end_seconds": 256.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "okay, that's enough for me. Taking everything into account, it fits best with suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.56,
      "end_seconds": 261.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Uh, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.27,
      "end_seconds": 296.82,
      "duration_seconds": 34.55,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors, and we'll watch how it goes. I'd like you to take levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. It's for contraception. Take the pill at the same time each day and use condoms if you miss two. We'll catch up in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 297.81,
      "end_seconds": 301.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Come by reception afterwards and I'll fix the appointment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.86,
      "end_seconds": 305.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'll note it it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.74,
      "end_seconds": 310.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "so, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.3,
      "end_seconds": 314.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.1,
      "end_seconds": 316.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
